Donation Stump was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the Magic of making the opponent lose 1G (effectively a smaller [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Sad_Customer Sad Customer]). '''Beta 50.1''' expanded that by also giving it a Synergy, which makes you earn 1G.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP: 4

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Magic: The enemy loses 1G. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Magic: The enemy loses 1G. Synergy: You earn 1G. (Post Beta 50.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
